PROBLEMS:
  ✗ Three separate execution sources — browser, VPS worker, Vercel cron
  ✗ Browser = primary source of truth if VPS worker down
  ✗ Go engine's paper account NOT connected to MongoDB paper_trades
  ✗ Strategies evaluated twice (Go engine ignores Node worker, vice versa)
  ✗ No browser = no trading (worker is optional VPS, not Render)
  ✗ State divergence possible between Go in-memory and MongoDB
